WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060
In step four, you will be confirming carrier and pallet information.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:10.120
Note that you'll only see this step if you're shipping pallets.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:16.280
The steps you take will be different depending on the carrier you selected in step two.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:21.433
For pallet shipments with non-partnered carriers, start by confirming how many pallets you will

00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:22.120
be shipping.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:26.784
Then select print to generate FBA pallet ID labels.

00:00:26.784 --> 00:00:33.240
These are different than the FBA box ID labels you applied in step three.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:36.105
Four labels will be provided for each pallet.

00:00:36.105 --> 00:00:41.120
Apply one label on each side of every pallet centered and near the top.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.820
You can now schedule pick up and hand off inventory to your selected carrier.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:53.430
In the final step, select proceed to enter tracking details to enter the PRO freight bill number

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:56.300
provided by your carrier and tracking information.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:01.580
You must enter tracking information for all non-partnered carrier shipments.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.820
Finish by clicking save to change your shipment status to shipped.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:11.580
You've now completed the send to Amazon workflow for non-partnered carrier pallet shipments.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:18.148
If you selected an Amazon partnered carrier, you'll need to enter your warehouse contact information

00:01:18.148 --> 00:01:19.900
by selecting add contact.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:25.420
You can select an existing warehouse contact or provide a new contact for each shipment.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:29.740
If there are multiple shipments, we'll use the first selected contact.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:35.854
You can change the contact for each additional shipment by clicking the contact information drop

00:01:35.854 --> 00:01:38.300
down arrow and selecting change contact.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.660
Next, put your boxes into pallet configurations.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.260
If you haven't done so already, then review your pallet details.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:51.260
These are pre-populated based on the information you provided in step one.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:55.180
Freight class is used to determine the billable weight and risk of a shipment.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.380
Ranked from 50 to 500, Freight class can be entered manually.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.580
You can also choose to use Amazon's estimates instead.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.940
Freight declared value is optional.

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:12.460
If left blank, we'll assume the value is $1.50 times the shipment weight.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:19.300
Next, enter pallet weight and height, whether the pallets are stacked or not, and the number of

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.780
pallets for each configuration.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.580
You can edit these details if anything is incorrect.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.580
Select confirm to receive estimated carrier charges.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:32.540
If you go back and edit your pallet details, charges will update accordingly.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.940
Next, you'll need to select your carrier and Freight ready date.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:42.556
We'll show you the lowest cost carrier by default, but you can choose a different one by selecting

00:02:42.556 --> 00:02:43.180
change carrier.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:50.316
In the carrier selection window, you can filter by carrier name or shipping mode to view estimated

00:02:50.316 --> 00:02:53.900
transportation cost, shipping mode, and available dates.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:58.220
If a date is gray, the carrier is at capacity for that day.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:05.033
Once your details are correct and you are ready to print pallet labels, select confirm carrier and

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:05.740
Pallet information.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.660
You're now ready to continue on to step five.
